WEBVTT

00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:00.454
you might expect more 
of the same down the road.

00:01:00.496 --> 00:01:03.454
If so, you might choose to avoid him
the next time you see him.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:08.038
That said, we can change our impressions
in light of new information.

00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:11.371
Behavioral researchers
have identified consistent patterns

00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:15.163
that seem to guide 
this process of impression updating.

00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:19.996
On one hand, learning very negative,
highly immoral information about someone

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.788
typically has a stronger impact

00:01:21.829 --> 00:01:25.538
than learning very positive,
highly moral information.

00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:28.538
So, unfortunately for our new friend
from the football game,

00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:30.621
his bad behavior at the game